%% menu-flow-v1
flowchart TD

menu__root["BC-250 compressed swap<br/>Inspect or configure a mutually exclusive compressed-swap profile."]:::root
action__status["Status overview<br/>Show the configured profile, active swap, zswap state, and swappiness."]:::read_only
action__zram["Use zram + disk (zstd)<br/>Half-RAM compressed swap at priority 100 with a 16 GiB disk fallback at priority 10. Disables zswap; reboot to apply."]:::install
action__zram_lz4["Use zram + disk (lz4)<br/>Fast lz4 compressed swap at priority 100 with a 16 GiB disk fallback at priority 10. Disables zswap; reboot to apply."]:::install
action__zswap["Use zswap + disk (lz4)<br/>Use fast lz4 zswap with a 10% RAM pool, memory shrinker, and 16 GiB disk swapfile at priority 10. Reboot to apply."]:::install
action__zswap_zstd["Use zswap + disk (zstd)<br/>Use higher-ratio zstd zswap with the same 10% RAM pool, memory shrinker, and 16 GiB disk swapfile. Reboot to apply."]:::install
action__remove["Remove toolkit profile<br/>Remove toolkit-owned swap settings and return to Valve's zram defaults."]:::cleanup
action__swappiness["Set swappiness (zram / zswap)<br/>Set vm.swappiness from 0 to 200 now and at boot. Applies to the selected profile; retained when switching profiles."]:::install
action__help["Full help<br/>Show profile details, CLI commands, paths, and reboot behavior."]:::read_only

